# Credentials and local environment files. These belong in the game directory,
# never in this repository - it is public, and a gitignored secret here is one
# 'git add -f' away from exposure. Listed defensively so that if one ever does
# appear, git refuses it rather than staging it.
.playtest_env
*.env
.env
!.env.example
secret_settings.py

